oofem.out
Slab under triangular-pulse distributed load
NlDEIDynamic nsteps 20000 deltat 1.e-6 dumpcoef 0. profileopt 1 contextOutputStep 100000 nmodules 1
vtkxmllattice primvars 1 1 cellvars 4 46 60 90 111 tstep_step 100 domain_all cross 1
domain 3d
OutputManager tstep_step 100 dofman_output { 5 }
ncrosssect 1 nmat 1 nbc 1 nic 0 nltf 2 nset 1
LatticeCS 1 material 1
LatticeFrameElastic 1 d 2400. tAlpha 0.0 E 30.e9 n 0.0
#@mesher t3d
#@INSERT_LIVELOADS
ConstantFunction 1 f(t) 1.0
# Triangular pulse: peak at t = 0.5 ms, end at 1 ms, then zero for the
# rest of the analysis (free vibration / dissipation phase).
PiecewiseLinFunction 2 nPoints 4 t 4 0.0 0.0005 0.001 0.02 f(t) 4 0.0 1.0 0.0 0.0
#@INSERT_SETS
#@LOAD patch 1 q 1.e2
#@DIR 0 0 -1
#@THICKNESS 0.01

#@BC curve 1 dofs 1 3 values 1 0
#@BC curve 2 dofs 1 3 values 1 0
#@BC curve 3 dofs 1 3 values 1 0
#@BC curve 4 dofs 1 3 values 1 0

#@BC vertex 1 dofs 3 1 2 3 values 3 0 0 0
#@BC vertex 2 dofs 2 2 3 values 2 0 0
#@BC vertex 3 dofs 1 3 values 1 0
#@BC vertex 4 dofs 1 3 values 1 0

#%BEGIN_CHECK%
#DOFMAN number 37 dof 3 type d
#REACTION number 33 dof 3
#REACTION number 35 dof 3
#REACTION number 37 dof 3
#TIME
#%END_CHECK%
